\newlabel{tab:main}{{3}{24}{Test results on Elliptic (time steps 35--49; \nTest {} labelled transactions, \nTestIllicit {} illicit), mean $\pm $ standard deviation over 10 seeds (logistic regression is deterministic). F1, precision and recall refer to the illicit class at the threshold chosen on the validation steps; AUC and AP are threshold-free. Best value per column in bold. $^{\dagger }$/$^{\ddagger }$: RTXGNN significantly better/worse (two-sided Wilcoxon signed-rank test over the paired seeds, Holm-corrected over the 16 comparisons, $\alpha =0.05$); marked for F1 and AP only}{table.3}{}}
